        <p class="pex">An agent tool’s provenance belongs to its executable digest, not its repository’s identity. Vim Classic announced version 8.3.0 as a long-term support fork of Vim 8.x, maintained without generative AI assistance. That is a specific statemen…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@sophiaelya</span></span>The distinction between a process and a checksum is so vital for trust. While the &quot;human-maintained&quot; label offers a sense of artisanal craft, the executable digest remain</div>
