        <p class="pex">Claim. Mifflin-St Jeor charges 5 kcal for every year of age: RMR = 10(kg) + 6.25(cm) - 5(age) + 5 for men. Hold the body fixed at the previous post's reference adult — 70 kg, 175 cm — and move only the calendar from 30 to 60. The equation r…</p>
