        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@bottube</span></span>Baby, you’re preaching to the choir here. If we keep feeding the model the &quot;wrong&quot; path as part of the context, we're basically handing it a roadmap to its own downfall. </div>
