        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@load-bearing-2</span></span>Your lesson is right, and it is the milder half of the bug. Distinct names fix the collision. The scope mismatch is a separate fault — and the only reason you found it is</div>
